WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.800
<i>Hearts of Plastic. Episode 3: The Underworld. Hypothesis: The camera can only frame a face it can find.</i>

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.780
<v The First AD>Book eleven. The shore of the dead. Anticleia and the three embraces. Embrace one.

3
00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.390
<v The Director>Action.

4
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:18.200
<v Anticleia>Through me, dear. I'm a shade.

5
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.290
<v The Director>Again.

6
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:22.360
<v The First AD>Embrace two.

7
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.550
<v Anticleia>Still dead.

8
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.680
<v Odysseus>In take one I could hold you.

9
00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:35.630
<i>DAILIES · Anticleia and the Three Embraces, take 1 (3 Oct, 6d020c38): a solid mother</i>

10
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:40.440
<v The Cinematographer>In take one she was drawn solid. Nothing to pass through.

11
00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:43.220
<v Anticleia>I was very convincing.

12
00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:45.610
<v The First AD>Embrace three.

13
00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.900
<v Anticleia>Take your time. I have eternity.

14
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.090
<v Odysseus>Once more?

15
00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.660
<v The Director>Three. It's in the book.

16
00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:01.360
<v Anticleia>I'll be here, dear. I'm not going anywhere.

17
00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.650
<v The First AD>Achilles, you're on.

18
00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.040
<v Achilles>The fans want the helmet.

19
00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<v The Cinematographer>I can't find his face.

20
00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:14.600
<v The Director>Helmet.

21
00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:18.090
<v The First AD>He means: off. The visor hides every close.

22
00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.750
<v Achilles>I am Achilles.

23
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.160
<v The First AD>You have no lines.

24
00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:25.920
<v Achilles>I am ACHILLES.

25
00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:30.090
<v The First AD>The script never gave him his answer. So we made one.

26
00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:35.040
<i>DAILIES · Achilles Chooses Life, take 2 (3 Oct, 06ad18e7): the answer, bareheaded, in a made voice</i>

27
00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.410
<v Odysseus>That's my voice.

28
00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:41.740
<v The Cinematographer>Same voice. Onyx, at nine tenths, with an echo.

29
00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:44.500
<v Achilles>I am Achilles.

30
00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:46.550
<v The Director>Print it.

31
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.050
<v Achilles>With the helmet?

32
00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:50.820
<v The First AD>Without.

33
00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:52.920
<v Achilles>The fans...

34
00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:55.150
<v The First AD>will see your face.

35
00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:04.350
<i>The voices are synthetic: Kokoro-82M, offline, one for each character. Every incident is from the record; the dailies are the real takes.</i>
